{{!-- THE (i): a small "what is this" beside a name (the module picker's rows), its words in THE tooltip. A button, so a
      tap on a phone and the keyboard's focus show it as well as the pointer (app.css .info-tip); type="button": it sits
      inside forms and must never submit one. Hash: tip. No newline at the end. --}}
<button type="button" class="info-tip" data-tip="{{tip}}" aria-label="{{tip}}">{{> icon-info}}</button>